# Policy-backed research board lanes

The six existing policy states remain visible. Cards are explicitly examples.
Whether Closed accepts ordinary work is the root's policy decision, passed in.

## Component BoardLanes (closedWorkAccepted: Bool)
State:
    Let phases be ["Inbox", "Ready", "Running", "Verify", "Review", "Closed"].
View:
    <div class="board-scroll"><div class="board">
      {for each phase in phases, keyed by phase:}
        <section class="column"><h2>{phase} <span>0</span></h2>
          {if phase is equal to "Inbox":}
            <article class="card"><h3>Characterize sparse verifier search</h3><p>Example fixture only · unassigned · not persisted</p></article>
          {end}
          {if phase is equal to "Ready":}
            <article class="card"><h3>Define admissible evidence</h3><p>Example fixture only · awaiting review</p></article>
          {end}
          {if phase is equal to "Running":}<p class="empty">No agent run has been started.</p>{end}
          {if phase is equal to "Verify":}<p class="empty">Evidence gates will appear here.</p>{end}
          {if phase is equal to "Review":}<p class="empty">Review decisions remain explicit.</p>{end}
          {if phase is equal to "Closed":}
            {if closedWorkAccepted:}<p class="empty closed-rule">Ordinary work is available.</p>
            {else:}<p class="empty closed-rule">Closed work is terminal unless an authorized reopen command succeeds.</p>{end}
          {end}
        </section>
      {end}
    </div></div>
Style:
    .board-scroll { width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; padding: 2px 2px 16px; }
    .board { min-width: 1460px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6,minmax(220px,1fr)); gap: 12px; }
    .column { min-height: 400px; padding: 13px; background: #e6e3da; border: 1px solid #d3cfc3; border-radius: 14px; }
    h2 { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #283c47; font-size: 12px; }
    h2 span { color: #52616a; }
    .card { margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 14px; background: #fffdf8; border: 1px solid #d6d2c7; border-radius: 11px; }
    h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #1b3440; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.35; }
    p { color: #56636b; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .empty { padding: 18px 10px; border: 1px dashed #c7c3b8; border-radius: 9px; text-align: center; }
